102	     * region derived from the owner's postcode (falling back to city — see {@link Localities}); HASH8
103	     * is the first 8 upper-case hex characters of SHA-256 over
104	     * {@code normalizedTelephone + lastName}. The telephone is normalized to E.164 the same way as in
105	     * {@link #identityKey(Owner)}, so owners differing only in telephone formatting share a code.
106	     */
107	    public static String customerCode(Owner owner) {
108	        String region = Localities.localityFor(owner.getCity(), owner.getPostcode());
